WEBVTT

00:05.137 --> 00:08.137
It seems there are ninjas
preparing to defect from the village.

00:08.203 --> 00:12.203
The chieftain has personally ordered me
to eliminate anyone acting suspicious.

00:13.137 --> 00:15.870
I'm sure that you'll both
get similar orders soon.

00:16.803 --> 00:18.603
And how are you going to handle it?

00:18.670 --> 00:21.203
Well, by killing the traitors,
of course.

00:22.070 --> 00:25.037
Even if they turn out
to be friends you hold dear?

00:25.770 --> 00:27.737
The organization
has given me everything.

00:27.803 --> 00:30.570
My name, my pride, my reason to live.

00:31.270 --> 00:32.937
This is the only place for me.

00:33.670 --> 00:35.737
Ninjas are meant to serve
the greater cause,

00:36.137 --> 00:38.137
and those who threaten it

00:38.537 --> 00:39.903
shall be eliminated.

00:44.970 --> 00:46.103
Zai!

00:47.603 --> 00:49.770
We've done everything that we can.

00:51.570 --> 00:53.337
<i>He may not accept it now,</i>

00:54.170 --> 00:57.037
<i>but I'm sure the day will come</i>
<i>when Zai will understand.</i>

01:04.570 --> 01:06.737
<i>It's time to make our move.</i>

02:11.003 --> 02:14.570
Even in the face of lightning
that tears the heavens apart,

02:15.070 --> 02:18.103
there is no greater majesty than today.

02:18.370 --> 02:19.870
Secret art:

02:20.070 --> 02:21.570
Thunderclap!

02:37.270 --> 02:39.403
You can revive all you want.

02:39.537 --> 02:41.970
I'll just keep killing you!

02:42.203 --> 02:44.570
Over and over!

02:47.570 --> 02:49.737
The quiet lake gleams
in the morning sun,

02:50.070 --> 02:52.470
with nary a ripple
from any boats to be found.

02:57.237 --> 02:58.537
Secret art:

02:58.937 --> 03:00.437
Serenity!

03:27.403 --> 03:30.703
<i>He's honed his five senses</i>
<i>to their peak!</i>

03:30.770 --> 03:32.637
<i>No, even beyond that!</i>

04:04.803 --> 04:05.803
Zai...

04:14.737 --> 04:17.303
You must have known
they were planning to defect!

04:17.937 --> 04:20.170
Why did you let them escape?

04:20.937 --> 04:23.003
Not going to talk, are you?

04:37.537 --> 04:38.903
It should have been obvious

04:38.970 --> 04:41.303
that becoming an exiled ninja
would mean death!

04:46.503 --> 04:49.603
You brought this all
upon yourself, Higan!

04:54.870 --> 04:58.370
You were a fool to ignore the code
and scorn our cause!

04:58.437 --> 05:00.937
This never would have
happened otherwise!

05:03.837 --> 05:05.237
We didn't ignore it!

05:06.370 --> 05:09.737
Mari and I realized that no code
or cause was worth following

05:09.803 --> 05:13.737
if it robbed us of our ability to love
and protect the things we held dear!

05:13.803 --> 05:15.270
We made a choice!

05:21.970 --> 05:25.537
You once said the organization was
the only place for you.

05:26.070 --> 05:29.237
But the two of us could never belong
in that village!

05:32.803 --> 05:36.137
Then why did you accept the pact
that we made together?

05:38.803 --> 05:41.070
Why did you lead me on
with all that crap?

05:44.503 --> 05:46.170
If I accompany you two,

05:47.170 --> 05:48.937
will I see new horizons?

05:51.603 --> 05:53.003
Is that possible?

05:55.070 --> 05:56.303
Let's journey together.

05:57.370 --> 05:59.570
It was the first time in my life

05:59.637 --> 06:01.503
that I truly believed I made friends!

06:01.970 --> 06:03.937
You betrayed more than the village.

06:04.003 --> 06:06.503
-You betrayed me!
-I meant everything I said!

06:06.570 --> 06:08.670
Because you were
another one of the people

06:08.737 --> 06:10.870
that both of us held dear to our hearts!

06:10.937 --> 06:12.637
-Which is why...
-Enough of your bullshit!

06:31.503 --> 06:33.503
That design, I recognize it!

06:33.570 --> 06:36.570
I did it to make sure
that we never forgot you!

06:37.670 --> 06:39.770
We always wanted to go on that journey,

06:40.270 --> 06:43.437
and find those new horizons
that we spoke about with you!

06:43.503 --> 06:44.670
Shut up!

06:44.737 --> 06:46.970
You're just trying to trick me again!

07:01.203 --> 07:02.970
I will not stop.

07:03.203 --> 07:05.070
Not until the ninja are dead.

07:05.137 --> 07:08.937
I have to bury the organization
that you said meant everything to you.

07:10.103 --> 07:12.070
It's the only reason I came here.

07:12.270 --> 07:14.637
There's an easy way to prove
which one of you is correct.

07:14.970 --> 07:16.770
You should both just fight it out.

07:16.870 --> 07:20.337
I came to prove to you
that what I believe in is right!

07:40.570 --> 07:43.303
I'm not wrong,

07:43.570 --> 07:45.303
you will see one day.

07:46.737 --> 07:48.870
Mari said something once.

07:50.837 --> 07:52.603
If Zai ever shows up,

07:53.070 --> 07:55.237
I intend to let him do what he wants.

07:56.303 --> 07:59.470
Whether he's driven by the code
or by his hatred.

08:00.470 --> 08:03.503
The very least we can do
is to make sure he spares Ren.

08:03.803 --> 08:05.603
Whatever the circumstances.

08:06.703 --> 08:08.370
Because Ren is the one,

08:08.437 --> 08:11.137
the only one who can show Zai
those new horizons.

08:12.503 --> 08:15.470
This small bundle of life will
make him understand

08:15.537 --> 08:18.170
that even people like us
can find our own futures.

08:18.303 --> 08:19.637
I'm certain of it.

08:34.003 --> 08:35.470
Listen, Zai.

08:35.737 --> 08:37.503
We can settle this later.

08:37.570 --> 08:41.170
We must sort out our present
instead of our past.

08:50.303 --> 08:51.303
Damn it!

08:51.637 --> 08:54.970
Gotta be a way, there's gotta be
some kind of clue she left behind,

08:55.037 --> 08:56.037
gotta be a way.

08:56.537 --> 08:58.037
Please don't scare me like that.

08:58.103 --> 08:59.703
Lock the door next time.

09:02.770 --> 09:03.870
Where's Duckie?

09:03.937 --> 09:06.270
He got a message,
challenging him to a duel.

09:06.503 --> 09:09.203
So he went to some scary ruins
that used to be a ninja hideout.

09:09.470 --> 09:11.937
A duel? With who?

09:12.003 --> 09:13.337
Beats me.

09:13.403 --> 09:15.437
Shit, talk about bad timing.

09:15.870 --> 09:18.403
What happened
with that big idea of yours?

09:19.003 --> 09:21.403
No luck. It just made things worse.

09:21.470 --> 09:23.837
-Worse?
-The feds will be coming for us soon.

09:24.037 --> 09:25.770
What about you? You got the data?

09:25.837 --> 09:27.503
I found the partition it was saved on.

09:27.570 --> 09:30.770
-But you still don't have it?
-I can't go any further than this.

09:30.870 --> 09:33.170
Everything requires
Emma's biometric signature!

09:33.237 --> 09:35.303
I tried to force my way in,
but nothing worked!

09:35.503 --> 09:36.703
I even searched the lab,

09:36.903 --> 09:40.303
but I couldn't find any fingerprints
much less a strand of her hair!

09:40.370 --> 09:43.803
She's like sentient security software
that leaves no frigging trace!

09:44.237 --> 09:46.503
Everything we've done
is gonna go up in smoke

09:46.603 --> 09:49.770
-unless we get our hands on that data!
-Don't take it out on me!

09:49.837 --> 09:51.537
You're the one who screwed things up!

09:58.037 --> 09:59.470
Care for a drink?

10:08.803 --> 10:10.137
<i>Care for a drink?</i>

10:10.203 --> 10:11.637
<i>Just like old times?</i>

10:18.837 --> 10:20.270
<i>This is a lovely drawing.</i>

10:21.303 --> 10:23.303
<i>It may seem like a curse to you now,</i>

10:23.370 --> 10:25.403
<i>but there might come a time</i>
<i>down the road</i>

10:25.470 --> 10:27.237
<i>when it proves to be useful.</i>

10:32.670 --> 10:35.070
<i>Hello. Apologies for the sudden call.</i>

10:36.003 --> 10:38.270
<i>I just wanted to have</i>
<i>a little chat with you.</i>

10:39.570 --> 10:41.937
<i>Do you remember the first time we met?</i>

10:42.970 --> 10:44.870
When the Secretary of Defense told me

10:44.937 --> 10:47.137
they had assigned ninjas
to be my bodyguards?

10:47.270 --> 10:49.537
I thought it was some kinda stupid joke.

10:50.403 --> 10:54.337
But you know,
I was struck by your integrity

10:54.403 --> 10:57.203
and how you never let emotions
get in your way.

10:57.270 --> 10:58.703
It left a profound impact on me.

11:00.637 --> 11:02.237
<i>That's a huge part of the reason</i>

11:02.303 --> 11:05.270
<i>why I agreed to create</i>
<i>the Gusoku gear for you guys.</i>

11:05.937 --> 11:08.237
<i>Not to mention I thought</i>
<i>it was an ideal way</i>

11:08.303 --> 11:11.003
<i>to further test and refine</i>
<i>my company's technology.</i>

11:13.537 --> 11:16.537
I had fun with it.
It was really exciting.

11:17.937 --> 11:20.603
But I guess
you didn't feel the same way.

11:20.670 --> 11:23.403
<i>-Did you?</i>
<i>-Things are not looking good, sir.</i>

11:23.470 --> 11:25.737
<i>We've already obtained</i>
<i>all the development data</i>

11:25.803 --> 11:27.803
<i>on the reactor and the Gusoku gear.</i>

11:28.137 --> 11:31.170
<i>It shouldn't be difficult for us</i>
<i>to establish our own production line.</i>

11:31.603 --> 11:33.570
<i>Then it's time to take our leave.</i>

11:39.403 --> 11:41.137
So, old man,

11:41.837 --> 11:45.837
<i>did you honestly think that I wasn't</i>
<i>going to catch on to your plans?</i>

11:46.537 --> 11:49.437
<i>I've constantly said that my goal</i>
<i>was to change the world.</i>

11:49.837 --> 11:51.470
<i>However, I don't think I've ever shared</i>

11:51.537 --> 11:54.603
<i>the concrete details</i>
<i>of my plan with you.</i>

11:54.737 --> 11:56.503
<i>You know something, Yamaji?</i>

11:56.603 --> 11:58.737
<i>I'm sick and tired of this world.</i>

11:59.703 --> 12:02.003
<i>But the energy that AUZA</i>
<i>is currently developing</i>

12:02.103 --> 12:03.637
<i>is akin to a miracle,</i>

12:04.137 --> 12:07.803
and once I obtain it,
the world is gonna change drastically.

12:08.670 --> 12:11.837
<i>It will bring momentous improvements</i>
<i>to people's everyday lives,</i>

12:11.937 --> 12:15.237
<i>and gradually solve</i>
<i>every major problem the world faces.</i>

12:16.337 --> 12:19.437
<i>Naturally, war will also change.</i>

12:20.103 --> 12:21.737
<i>Weapons will become so powerful</i>

12:21.903 --> 12:24.737
<i>that common the sense of today</i>
<i>won't be able to handle them anymore.</i>

12:24.970 --> 12:26.570
<i>And under my control,</i>

12:27.303 --> 12:29.770
<i>humanity will take</i>
<i>its next step in evolution.</i>

12:31.037 --> 12:35.003
<i>I promise that I'll put all the data</i>
<i>I got from you guys to good use.</i>

12:36.670 --> 12:38.870
Farewell, Yamaji.

13:34.103 --> 13:35.503
<i>Joseph.</i>

13:36.037 --> 13:37.737
I remember it all.

13:37.970 --> 13:39.337
Every last detail.

13:40.203 --> 13:41.203
<i>But how?</i>

13:42.737 --> 13:44.170
Farewell.

14:31.837 --> 14:33.170
Who is that?

14:47.503 --> 14:48.603
<i>Suspect spotted.</i>

14:49.103 --> 14:52.537
<i>Currently in pursuit of their truck</i>
<i>going northwest on highway 16.</i>

14:53.037 --> 14:54.603
<i>Requesting immediate backup!</i>

15:08.270 --> 15:09.503
Mr. Joseph, sir!

15:09.570 --> 15:10.703
Come with us.

15:51.703 --> 15:52.703
Dilly!

15:53.170 --> 15:55.437
If I was here to kill you,
you'd be dead already.

16:02.437 --> 16:04.770
Wait!
There's a helicopter up on the roof!

16:04.937 --> 16:06.203
It's too late for that.

16:06.703 --> 16:08.270
<i>We'll head for the lab.</i>

16:09.403 --> 16:11.603
<i>Stop the car! Pull over right now!</i>

16:24.603 --> 16:27.203
Exit the vehicle
and put your hands on the ground!

16:33.437 --> 16:35.037
It's up to you now.

16:38.637 --> 16:40.103
Yes! Yes!

16:40.570 --> 16:44.003
This is it!

16:44.737 --> 16:46.470
Yeah, baby!

16:47.170 --> 16:49.103
<i>Emma's fingerprint should be on this.</i>

16:52.470 --> 16:54.470
How long do we have until they get here?

16:54.637 --> 16:56.303
Don't worry, just keep hacking.

16:56.370 --> 16:57.803
I'll go buy you some time.

16:59.203 --> 17:00.703
It's all or nothing now.

17:09.070 --> 17:10.337
Yeah!

17:10.503 --> 17:14.370
<i>I can already see the sorry look</i>
<i>on that loser CEO's face!</i>

17:31.837 --> 17:33.570
Don't worry, I've got your back!

17:33.637 --> 17:36.670
Just relax, I'll deal with them
even if you miss.

17:44.270 --> 17:45.570
Hell yeah!

17:45.637 --> 17:47.770
You know, playing with a real gun

17:47.837 --> 17:50.170
is way more fun
than playing FPS videogames!

17:58.970 --> 18:00.103
Yamaji.

18:14.270 --> 18:17.070
Your methods cannot change the world.

18:17.903 --> 18:20.637
I guess I'm not the only one
with a big head!

18:21.637 --> 18:22.870
Dilly.

18:23.203 --> 18:25.103
Yet another traitor, I see.

18:26.570 --> 18:27.570
A traitor?

18:28.437 --> 18:30.037
As I recall,

18:30.103 --> 18:34.070
you were the one who ordered me
to act as Joseph's bodyguard.

18:34.137 --> 18:35.203
Were you not?

18:35.703 --> 18:36.970
Very well.

18:37.237 --> 18:39.570
Then let's find out
if you can uphold those orders.

18:49.237 --> 18:50.537
Forgive me.

18:52.570 --> 18:53.570
Dilly!

19:01.637 --> 19:03.003
Dilly.

20:07.370 --> 20:10.937
<i>We've just gotten a new lead</i>
<i>on the location of two exiles.</i>

20:13.070 --> 20:14.803
One is Higan.

20:15.470 --> 20:17.203
The other is Mari.

20:19.137 --> 20:20.437
And on top of that,

20:21.303 --> 20:23.070
they have a child.

20:23.137 --> 20:24.537
All of them must die.

20:25.637 --> 20:27.903
This is in the name of our great cause.

20:32.703 --> 20:34.670
Zai, I trust you.

20:58.637 --> 21:01.670
<i>You really like</i>
<i>looking at the stars, don't you?</i>

21:04.037 --> 21:05.503
Not really.

21:05.570 --> 21:07.437
I gaze at them to remember.

21:08.503 --> 21:11.003
Reflecting on the time in my life
when I was weak

21:11.070 --> 21:14.703
and could only stare at the ground.
It's how I maintain discipline.

21:15.303 --> 21:17.303
You know, every ninja
that is part of our organization

21:17.370 --> 21:18.870
has an unfortunate past.

21:20.237 --> 21:21.770
But personally speaking,

21:21.903 --> 21:24.437
I refuse to let it be a curse
that holds me down.

21:25.070 --> 21:27.637
It's history.
We cannot pretend it doesn't exist.

21:27.703 --> 21:28.703
True.

21:29.737 --> 21:33.337
But we are always free to choose
which direction to focus ourselves in.

21:34.903 --> 21:37.070
It's possible for us
to look into the future

21:37.670 --> 21:39.937
instead of always being stuck
in the past.

21:41.270 --> 21:43.170
What do you mean by "future"?

21:43.570 --> 21:45.237
I'm not sure yet.

21:45.337 --> 21:47.837
But someday, I think I'll figure it out.

21:49.503 --> 21:53.303
Then perhaps that is
the "new horizon" we seek.

21:55.603 --> 21:57.337
<i>I sure hope so.</i>

21:59.603 --> 22:01.537
<i>Mari said something once.</i>

22:01.737 --> 22:06.003
<i>"I think Ren is the one who can</i>
<i>show Zai those new horizons".</i>

22:07.570 --> 22:09.770
<i>This small bundle of life</i>
<i>will make him understand</i>

22:09.837 --> 22:12.903
<i>that even people like us</i>
<i>can find our own futures.</i>

22:13.437 --> 22:14.903
<i>I'm certain of it.</i>
